  "notes": [
    "The default server additions require no companion mods on joining clients. Lootr has been retired from automatic installation.",
    "Litematica and MaLiLib are packaged as an optional client bundle and must never be copied to the server mods folder.",
    "Fresh Animations, Entity Model Features, and Entity Texture Features are an explicitly selected client bundle; each player downloads the exact reference-only ZIP/JARs directly, and none are installed on the server.",
    "The Fresh ZIP targets resourcepacks and EMF/ETF target client mods, but portable exports retain only official URLs and verification metadata; no raw Fresh-stack file is embedded or rehosted.",
    "Chunky only changes terrain by explicit administrator commands; no pre-generation starts automatically.",
    "ServerCore gameplay-changing optimizations remain disabled by its defaults.",
    "Players choosing the optional Litematica bundle need its declared Fabric API dependency; it is not required just to join this server."
  ],
